<!-- ============================================ 
  Síntesis de la lección (discusión de cierre)
=================================================  -->
<subsubsection xml:id="lec-expresionesDeMultiplicacion-sintesis" component="profesor">
  <shorttitle><custom ref="synthesis-leccion-titulo"/></shorttitle>
  <title><custom ref="synthesis-leccion-titulo"/></title>
  <title component="profesor"><nbsp/>(10 mins)</title>

  <p>[+++++++++++++++]</p>
  <p>Display the drawing of equal groups, tape diagram, situation, and expression from Activity 2.</p>
<p><q>Hemos aprendido cómo representar la multiplicación de varias maneras. Compartan con su compañero algo que aprendieron hoy</q> (Multiplication can be shown with drawings of equal groups or with diagrams. Multiplication can be real-world situations that involve equal groups. Multiplication can be expressed using the multiplication symbol (<m>\times</m>). An expression like <m>4\times5</m> means the total number of objects in 4 groups of 5.)</p>

</subsubsection>



